      ]
    },
    "long_instructions": "## Guess the Number\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1. Find where to write your `while` loop inside the `playGame()` function.\r\n\r\n2. Use AI to help you complete the `while` loop so that it keeps asking the player for a guess until they guess the number correctly. \r\n\r\n3. Make sure to test your loop so it stops when the user is correct and doesn’t become an infinite loop.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>Need help? Ask the AI Tutor.</summary>\r\n  \t<ol>\r\n      \t<li>How do I update a state variable for the current guess?</li>\r\n  \t\t<li>How do I end the loop when the user has guessed correctly?</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n</details>",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Finish the **while loop** for the Guess the Number game.",
    "display_name": "Guess the Number",
